borhood where neighbors greet you with a smile and a wave as they walk their dogs.\n\nStep inside to discover stunning new flooring throughout the home. Enjoy the new stove and you have the refrigerator included. You will never have to worry about storage. In the backyard, There is 10x12 shed. You'll love the spacious Great Room with its cozy fireplace, perfect for relaxing. The open layout seamlessly connects the dining area and kitchen, making it ideal for entertaining or enjoying your downtime.\n\nDown the hall, you'll find two well-sized bedrooms and a shared bathroom, while the master suite is privately located on the other side of the home, offering a peaceful retreat from the outside world.\n\nFree-Portable Storage 10'-12' with the house.\n\nThis deal won’t last long—call today to schedule your showing!\n\nFind out more here: https://www.homes.com/property/5202-j-i-bruce-dr-temple-tx/7dng33hz84wlp/ \ni35 Group is a group of hard-working real estate agents always striving to get the best deal for our buyers and the most money for our sellers. We are neighborhood experts in Central Texas. Choose us for your real estate needs. \n\nContact an i35 Group real estate agent today:\nBill Vernon - 254.495.5661\nRachel Leslie - 254.226.5889\nOffice - (888) 559-5217\nLocated at 300 W Central Texas Expressway, KILLEEN, TX 76541\nConnect with us on social media - stay up-to-date with events:\nhttps://linktr.ee/i35group", "channel_id": "UClqYZw4Suu5WVPGFlm8Tgeg", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClqYZw4Suu5WVPGFlm8Tgeg", "duration": 10, "view_count": 18, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y3bL184hzH0", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": ["#i35group", "#kw", "#kellerwilliams", "#centraltx", "#killeen", "#forthood", "#temple", "#belton", "#waco", "#harkerheights", "#realestate", "#homesweethome", "#buying", "#selling", "#househunting", "real estate", "real estate investing", "real estate agent"], "playable_in_embed": true, "